OL,3,GNEWSARiver closure planned for #8.3m
OL,4,Abridge project
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of the River Nene will be
OL,7,Ftemporarily closed to allow works to
OL,8,Fcontinue on a new #8.3m footbridge.
OL,10,FRestrictions will be in place from
OL,11,FMonday until 24 December to allow the
OL,12,Finstallation of key sections of Cygnet
OL,13,FBridge in Peterborough.
OL,15,FThe bridge is intended to improve links
OL,16,Fbetween the south of the city and
OL,17,FPeterborough city centre.
OL,19,FAn Environment Agency notice said river
OL,20,Fnavigation would be prohibited around
OL,21,Fthe construction site, with the closure
OL,22,Fenforced by river booms and signage.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
